            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हा पक्षी आता नामशेष झाला आहे. hā pakṣī ātā nāmśeṣ jhālā āhe. This bird has now died out."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो नामशेष झाला, to nāmśeṣ jhālā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नाम, the name, and शेष, what is left: only the name remains."
            }
          ]
        },
