          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नामशेष होणे (nāmśeṣ hoṇe) joins nāmaśeṣa, \"of whom only the name is left\", built from Sanskrit nāman, \"name\", and śeṣa, \"remainder\" (Monier-Williams), to होणे."
            }
